{"1-7":{"people":[{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":3,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"joshua-h3091g","name":"Joshua","kind":"person","brief":"A judge","count":1,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"joseph-h3130g","name":"Joseph","kind":"person","brief":"Jacob's son","count":1,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"gad-h1410g","name":"Gad","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"manasseh-h4519g","name":"Manasseh","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"moses-h4872","name":"Moses","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Amram","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"reuben-h7205","name":"Reuben","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":7}],"places":[{"id":"shiloh-h7887","name":"Shiloh","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"jordan-h3383","name":"Jordan","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":7}],"words":[{"base":"H5159","lemma":"נַחֲלָה","tr":"na·cha·lah","gloss":"inheritance","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":222},{"base":"H2506","lemma":"חֵ֫לֶק","tr":"che·leq","gloss":"portion","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":67},{"base":"H7626","lemma":"שֵׁ֫בֶט","tr":"she·vet","gloss":"tribe: staff","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":190},{"base":"H7651","lemma":"שֶׁ֫בַע","tr":"she·va","gloss":"seven","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":394},{"base":"H9036","lemma":"כֶם","tr":"khem","gloss":"you","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":591},{"base":"H2505","lemma":"חָלַק","tr":"cha·laq","gloss":"to divide","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":65},{"base":"H3789","lemma":"כָּתַב","tr":"ka·tav","gloss":"to write","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":224},{"base":"H1366","lemma":"גְּבוּל","tr":"ge·vul","gloss":"border: boundary","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":240},{"base":"H5975","lemma":"עָמַד","tr":"a·mad","gloss":"to stand: stand","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":521},{"base":"H3533","lemma":"כָּבַשׁ","tr":"ka·vash","gloss":"to subdue","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":14}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"JOS","chapter":19,"verse":51,"verseEnd":51,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"These are the inheritances that Eleazar the priest, Joshua son of Nun, and the heads of the families distributed by lot to the tribes of Israel at Shiloh before the LORD at the entrance to the Tent of Meeting. So they finished dividing up the land.","from":1},{"book":"JDG","chapter":18,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"They answered, “Come on, let us go up against them, for we have seen the land, and it is very good. Why would you fail to act? Do not hesitate to go there and take possession of the land!","from":3},{"book":"PRO","chapter":13,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"The slacker craves yet has nothing, but the soul of the diligent is fully satisfied.","from":3},{"book":"JOS","chapter":13,"verse":33,"verseEnd":33,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"To the tribe of Levi, however, Moses had given no inheritance. The LORD, the God of Israel, is their inheritance, just as He had promised them.","from":7},{"book":"JOS","chapter":14,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Their inheritance was assigned by lot for the nine and a half tribes, as the LORD had commanded through Moses.","from":6},{"book":"JOS","chapter":21,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"at Shiloh in the land of Canaan and said to them, “The LORD commanded through Moses that we be given cities in which to live, together with pasturelands for our livestock.”","from":1},{"book":"1SA","chapter":1,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Year after year Elkanah would go up from his city to worship and sacrifice to the LORD of Hosts at Shiloh, where Eliʼs two sons, Hophni and Phinehas, were priests to the LORD.","from":1},{"book":"PRO","chapter":10,"verse":4,"verseEnd":4,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Idle hands make one poor, but diligent hands bring wealth.","from":3}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":6},{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":2}]},"8-10":{"people":[{"id":"joshua-h3091g","name":"Joshua","kind":"person","brief":"A judge","count":3,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":1,"firstVerse":10}],"places":[{"id":"shiloh-h7887","name":"Shiloh","kind":"place","brief":"","count":3,"firstVerse":8}],"words":[{"base":"H7887","lemma":"שִׁלוֹ","tr":"shi·loh","gloss":"Shiloh","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":32},{"base":"H3091","lemma":"יְהוֹשׁוּעַ","tr":"ye·ho·shu·a","gloss":"Joshua","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":218},{"base":"H3789","lemma":"כָּתַב","tr":"ka·tav","gloss":"to write","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":224},{"base":"H1486","lemma":"גּוֹרָל","tr":"go·ral","gloss":"allotted","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":77},{"base":"H7993","lemma":"שָׁלַךְ","tr":"sha·lakh","gloss":"to throw","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":125},{"base":"H0582","lemma":"אֱנוֹשׁ","tr":"e·nosh","gloss":"human","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":565},{"base":"H4256","lemma":"מַחֲלֹ֫קֶת","tr":"ma·cha·lo·qet","gloss":"division","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":42},{"base":"H2505","lemma":"חָלַק","tr":"cha·laq","gloss":"to divide","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":65},{"base":"H2506","lemma":"חֵ֫לֶק","tr":"che·leq","gloss":"portion","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":67},{"base":"H6311","lemma":"פֹּה","tr":"poh","gloss":"here","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":82}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"COL","chapter":1,"verse":12,"verseEnd":12,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"giving thanks to the Father, who has qualified you to share in the inheritance of the saints in the light.","from":10},{"book":"GEN","chapter":13,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Get up and walk around the land, through its length and breadth, for I will give it to you.”","from":8},{"book":"JOS","chapter":7,"verse":16,"verseEnd":18,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So Joshua arose early the next morning and had Israel come forward tribe by tribe, and the tribe of Judah was selected. He had the clans of Judah come forward, and the clan of the Zerahites was selected. He had the clan of the Zerahites come forward, and the family of Zabdi was selected. And he had the family of Zabdi come forward man by man, and Achan son of Carmi, the son of Zabdi, the son of Zerah, of the tribe of Judah, was selected.","from":8},{"book":"JOS","chapter":13,"verse":7,"verseEnd":7,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now therefore divide this land as an inheritance to the nine tribes and the half-tribe of Manasseh.”","from":8},{"book":"JOS","chapter":14,"verse":1,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now these are the portions that the Israelites inherited in the land of Canaan, as distributed by Eleazar the priest, Joshua son of Nun, and the heads of the families of the tribes of Israel. Their inheritance was assigned by lot for the nine and a half tribes, as the LORD had commanded through Moses.","from":8},{"book":"JOS","chapter":15,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now the allotment for the clans of the tribe of Judah extended to the border of Edom, to the Wilderness of Zin at the extreme southern boundary:","from":8},{"book":"JOS","chapter":18,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"When you have mapped out the seven portions of land and brought it to me, I will cast lots for you here in the presence of the LORD our God.","from":8},{"book":"JOS","chapter":18,"verse":6,"verseEnd":6,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"When you have mapped out the seven portions of land and brought it to me, I will cast lots for you here in the presence of the LORD our God.","from":10}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"11-20":{"people":[{"id":"benjamin-h1144g