:1,"firstVerse":28}],"words":[{"base":"H1026","lemma":"בֵּית הָֽעֲרָבָה","tr":"bet ha·a·ra·vah","gloss":"Beth-arabah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":6},{"base":"H1031","lemma":"בֵּית חׇגְלָה","tr":"bet chog·lah","gloss":"Beth-hoglah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":6},{"base":"H1008","lemma":"בֵּֽיתְ־אֵל","tr":"bet-el","gloss":"Bethel","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":142},{"base":"H5892","lemma":"עִיר","tr":"ir","gloss":"excitement","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":1090},{"base":"H1144","lemma":"בִּנְיָמִין","tr":"bin·ya·min","gloss":"Benjamin","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":166},{"base":"H2691","lemma":"חָצֵר","tr":"cha·tser","gloss":"court","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":191},{"base":"H4940","lemma":"מִשְׁפָּחָה","tr":"mish·pa·chah","gloss":"family","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":303},{"base":"H6240","lemma":"עָשָׂר","tr":"a·sar","gloss":"ten","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":337},{"base":"H6762","lemma":"צֵלַע","tr":"tse·la","gloss":"Zela","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"H6787","lemma":"צְמָרַיִם","tr":"tse·ma·ra·yim","gloss":"(Mount) Zemaraim","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"2SA","chapter":21,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"And they buried the bones of Saul and his son Jonathan in Zela in the land of Benjamin, in the tomb of Saulʼs father Kish. After they had done everything the king had commanded, God answered their prayers for the land.","from":28},{"book":"GEN","chapter":10,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"the Arvadites, the Zemarites, and the Hamathites. Later the Canaanite clans were scattered,","from":22},{"book":"NUM","chapter":26,"verse":54,"verseEnd":54,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Increase the inheritance for a large tribe and decrease it for a small one; each tribe is to receive its inheritance according to the number of those registered.","from":28},{"book":"NUM","chapter":33,"verse":54,"verseEnd":54,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And you are to divide the land by lot according to your clans. Give a larger inheritance to a larger clan and a smaller inheritance to a smaller one. Whatever falls to each one by lot will be his. You will receive an inheritance according to the tribes of your fathers.","from":28},{"book":"JOS","chapter":2,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then Joshua son of Nun secretly sent two spies from Shittim, saying, “Go, inspect the land, especially Jericho.” So they went and entered the house of a prostitute named Rahab and stayed there.","from":21},{"book":"JOS","chapter":6,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now Jericho was tightly shut up because of the Israelites. No one went out and no one came in.","from":21},{"book":"JOS","chapter":7,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"He had the clans of Judah come forward, and the clan of the Zerahites was selected. He had the clan of the Zerahites come forward, and the family of Zabdi was selected.","from":25},{"book":"JOS","chapter":9,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So the Israelites set out and on the third day arrived at their cities—Gibeon, Chephirah, Beeroth, and Kiriath-jearim.","from":25}],"notes":[],"groups":[]}}